{
  "description": "Golden vectors for assertion id scheme 2 (contract C3). Every SDK and the engine must reproduce canonical_spec, canonical_input and id exactly from scope_id, assertion_type, spec_json (raw JSON text, kept as a string so 1.0, -0 and 1e21 survive parsing) and occurrence_index.",
  "recipe": [
    "canonical_spec = RFC 8785 (JCS) serialization of spec_json: object keys sorted by UTF-16 code units, ES6 Number::toString numbers (1.0 -\u003e 1, -0 -\u003e 0, 1e21 -\u003e 1e+21), minimal string escaping (only quote, backslash and control characters below U+0020), no whitespace, UTF-8 output.",
    "canonical_input = JCS array [scope_id, assertion_type, canonical_spec_value, occurrence_index]; scope_id is the raw scope identifier string (test node id or ContinuousEvalRunner name), never a hash; occurrence_index is a 0-based integer.",
    "id = \"a2_\" + first 32 lowercase hex characters of SHA-256 over the UTF-8 bytes of canonical_input."
  ],
