  "invalid_description": "Inputs for which no id can be computed. Implementations MUST reject a lone (unpaired) surrogate and invalid UTF-8 in spec keys, spec string values, scope_id and assertion_type; expected is always \"error\". spec_json is raw JSON text; scope_id_bytes_hex, when present, is the scope_id as raw UTF-8 bytes (hex) that cannot be decoded.",
